"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\",\"???\"];\nvar bQLTE = parseInt('0');\nconst iBwanNumber = 6;\nvar sLTEmodulename = 'LTE';\nconst bNewWLWAN = parseInt('1');\n</textarea><form action=/cgi-bin/v2x00.cgi method=post name=frm><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=700><tr><td><div id=vpninfo ng-show=vpninfo><br><br><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=0 id=cfmtbl width=560><tr><td translate>Please note that the Vigor router will send the WAN or Internet IP address of the router to VPN Matcher server.</td></tr><tr><td id=link_terms translate>This function is related to VPN Matcher service, please refer to the <a>Terms of Service</a> on VPN Matcher.</td></tr><tr><td align=center><br><input class=btnw name=cfmOk onclick=onClkCfmOk() type=button value=\"{{ 'OK' | translate }}\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <input class=btnw name=cfmCcl onclick=onClkCfmCcl() type=button value=\"{{ 'Cancel' | translate }}\"></td></tr></table></div></td></tr><tr><td><b parent=\"{{ 'VPN and Remote Access' | translate }}\" sub-title translate>VPN Matcher Setup</b><hr><table align=center border=1 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=100%><tr><td><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=4 width=95%><tr><td colspan=3><label><input name=iCloudSrvEn ng-model=iCloudSrvEn ng-value=1 type=radio value=1>&nbsp;<translate>Enable</translate>&nbsp;&nbsp;</label><label><input name=iCloudSrvEn ng-model=iCloudSrvEn ng-value=0 type=radio value=0>&nbsp;<translate>Disable</translate></label></td></tr><tr><td><translate>WAN interface</translate>:</td><td><select name=iInterface ng-model=interfaceSelected ng-options=\"item as item.label for item in interfaces track by item.id\"></select></td></tr><tr><td width=30%><translate>VPN Matcher Server</translate>:</td><td><input id=sCloudSrv name=sCloudSrv size=22 type=text> : <input id=iCloudPort name=iCloudPort size=5 type=text value=31503></td><td></td></tr><tr style=display:none><td><translate>Account</translate>:</td><td><input id=sCloudAcnt name=sCloudAcnt size=22 type=text></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><translate>Router List Key</translate>:</td><td><input id=sCloudPass name=sCloudPass size=22 type=password></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b><translate>Note</translate>:</b></td><td colspan=2 id=link_dashboard translate>You can get your Router List Key on <a>VPN Matcher Dashboard</a>.</td><tr><tr><td align=center colspan=3><input class=btnw onclick=onClkOK() type=button value=\"{{ 'OK' | translate }}\"></td><tr><tr><td colspan=3><translate>NAT Detection</translate><br><hr size=1></td></tr><tr><td translate>STUN Server</td><td><input name=stun_detect type=button value=\"{{ 'Detect' | translate }}\"></td><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=3 id=stun_result></td></tr><tr><td colspan=2 translate>Group Device List</td><td><input class=btnw3 id=getvpnlist type=button value=\"{{ 'Get List' | translate }}\"></td></tr><tr id=cloudvpnlist ng-show=cloudvpnlist><td colspan=4><table align=center cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 class=config width=100%><thead><tr><td translate>Index</td><td translate>Description</td><td translate>MAC</td><td translate>Remote Network</td><td translate>Model</td><td translate>Role</td><td translate>Profile</td></tr></thead><tbody id=cloudlist></tbody></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><input name=webchange type=hidden value=0><input name=iProfileIdx type=hidden value=\"1\"><input name=sFormAuthStr type=hidden value=\"pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA\"><input name=fid type=hidden value=2204><input name=sAct type=hidden value=savesrv><input name=aVpnProfiles type=hidden value></td></tr></table></form><script> top.ACTION_STATUS=-1;top.iActionStatusFlag='0';top.iFwUpgradeState='0';top.act_sta.damage_alert();var bg=parent;var f=document.frm;initWebChange();var appeinitScript=document.createElement('script');appeinitScript.text=document.getElementById(\"cloudvpn1init\").value;document.head.appendChild(appeinitScript);var aryVPNType=[\"VPN Client\",\"VPN Server\"];var iCntryChina='0';var bOpenVPN=parseInt('1');angular.element(document).ready(function(){if(iCntryChina==1)var server=(aryServer[0]==\"\")?\"cloud.draytek.com.cn\":aryServer[0];else var server=(aryServer[0]==\"\")?\"vpn-matcher.draytek.com\":aryServer[0];f.sCloudSrv.value=server;if(aryServer[1]!=0){f.iCloudPort.value=aryServer[1];} f.sCloudPass.value=aryServer[3]; $scope.iCloudSrvEn=aryServer[5];var list=window.localStorage.getItem(\"CloudVPNList\");if(list)adddatatolist(JSON.parse(list));var lasttime=window.localStorage.getItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\");if(lasttime){var timestamp=(new Date()).getTime();if(timestamp-lasttime<(90*1000)){ f.stun_detect.disabled=true;document.getElementById(\"stun_result\").innerHTML=gettext(\"Waiting for detection result...Please do not leave this page.\");setTimeout(updateStunTest,2000);}else window.localStorage.removeItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\");}f.stun_detect.onclick=function(){$http.get('/cgi-bin/v2x00.cgi',{params:{sFormAuthStr:'pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA',fid:'2204',sAct:'detect'}});this.disabled=true;document.getElementById(\"stun_result\").innerHTML=gettext(\"Waiting for detection result...Please do not leave this page.\");if(window.localStorage.getItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\"))window.localStorage.removeItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\");var timestamp=(new Date()).getTime();window.localStorage.setItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\",timestamp);setTimeout(updateStunTest,2000);}; angular.element(document.querySelectorAll(\"#link_dashboard a, #link_terms a\")).attr(\"href\",\"javascript:goDash()\");$scope.interfaces=[];for(let i=0;i<iBwanNumber;i++){if(top.notSupportWAN.indexOf(i)!=-1)continue;if(((i+1==3&&!bNewWLWAN)||(i+1==5&&bNewWLWAN))&&bQLTE){$scope.interfaces.push({id:i*2,label:gettext(sLTEmodulename+' First')});$scope.interfaces.push({id:i*2+1,label:gettext(sLTEmodulename+' Only')});}else{$scope.interfaces.push({id:i*2,label:gettext('WAN{{num}} First').replace('{{num}}',(i+1))});$scope.interfaces.push({id:i*2+1,label:gettext('WAN{{num}} Only').replace('{{num}}',(i+1))});}}$scope.interfaceSelected=$scope.interfaces.find(function(obj){return obj.id===aryServer[6];});$scope.$apply();});function goDash(){window.open(\"http://vpn-matcher.draytek.com/dashboard\",\"dashboard\",\"toolbars=no,width=1000px,height=700px,top=150px,left=\"+(screen.width/2-232)+\"px,status=no,scrollbars=yes,resize=yes,menubar=no\");}document.getElementById(\"getvpnlist\").onclick=function(){var srv=f.sCloudSrv.value;var pass=f.sCloudPass.value;pass=encodeURIComponent(pass).replace(/[!'()*]/g,function(c){return'%'+c.charCodeAt(0).toString(16);});$http.get(\"///\"+srv+\"/api/getlist/\"+aryServer[4]+\"/\"+pass).then(function(response){var str=response.data;str=str.slice(str.indexOf(\"(\")+1,-1);if(showErr(str.slice(1,-1)))return;showData(JSON.parse(str));});};function showErr(data){if(data==\"errauth\"){alert(gettext(\"Fail to authenticate your MAC address and list key.\"));return 1;}else if(data==\"errnodevice\"){alert(gettext(\"Device does not exist. Please add your device on the vpn-matcher website, and try again.\"));return 1;}else if(data==\"errmac\"){alert(gettext(\"Fail to find your MAC address.\"));return 1;}return 0;}function showData(result){ for(i=0;i<result.length;i++){result[i].push(-1);}var local_CloudVPNList=window.localStorage.getItem(\"CloudVPNList\");if(local_CloudVPNList){localdata=JSON.parse(local_CloudVPNList);for(i=0;i<result.length;i++){for(j=0;j<localdata.length;j++){if(result[i][1]==localdata[j][1])result[i][5]=localdata[j][5];}}}else{for(i=0;i<result.length;i++){var tmp=result[i][2].split(\"/\");for(j=0;j<aryVPNProf.length;j++){if(tmp[1]==aryVPNProf[j][3]&&bg.isEqualLan(aryVPNProf[j][1],aryVPNProf[j][2],tmp[0])){ result[i][5]=j+1;break;}}}}var data=JSON.stringify(result); adddatatolist(result);if(window.localStorage.getItem(\"CloudVPNList\"))window.localStorage.removeItem(\"CloudVPNList\");window.localStorage.setItem(\"CloudVPNList\",data);}function adddatatolist(list){ const aVpn=f.aVpnProfiles;document.getElementById(\"cloudlist\").innerHTML=\"\"; for(var i=0;i<list.length;i++){str=\"\";str+=\"<tr><td>\"+(i+1)+\"</td><td>\"+list[i][0]+\"</td><td>\"+list[i][1]+\"</td><td>\"+list[i][2];str+=\"</td><td>\"+list[i][3]+\"</td><td nowrap='nowrap'>\"+aryVPNType[list[i][4]]+\"</td><td>\";if(CompareMAC(list[i][1],aryServer[4])==1) str+=\"--\";else if(!bOpenVPN&&list[i][3].toUpperCase()==\"PC\")str+=\"--\";else{var titl=\"\";if(list[i][5]!=-1){if(list[i][3].toUpperCase()==\"PC\")titl=\"title=\"+aryRmVPNProf[list[i][5]-1];else titl=\"title=\"+aryVPNProf[list[i][5]-1][0];aVpn.value+=list[i][5]+\",\";}if(list[i][3].toUpperCase()==\"PC\")str+=\"<a \\\"\"+titl+\"\\\" href=javascript:onGetProfile(\"+list[i][5]+\",'\"+list[i][1]+\"','PC')>\";else str+=\"<a \\\"\"+titl+\"\\\" href=javascript:onGetProfile(\"+list[i][5]+\",'\"+list[i][1]+\"','')>\";if(list[i][5]==-1)str+=gettext(\"Create Profile\");else{if(list[i][3].toUpperCase()==\"PC\"){str+=list[i][5]+\" - \"+aryRmVPNProf[list[i][5]-1];}else{str+=list[i][5]+\" - \"+aryVPNProf[list[i][5]-1][0];}}str+=\"</a>\";}str+=\"</td></tr>\"; document.getElementById(\"cloudlist\").insertAdjacentHTML(\"beforeend\",str);$scope.cloudvpnlist=1;}aVpn.value=aVpn.value.slice(0,-1);}function CompareMAC(cloudmac,localmac){var mac=cloudmac.substring(0,2).toString()+cloudmac.substring(3,5)+cloudmac.substring(6,8)+cloudmac.substring(9,11)+cloudmac.substring(12,14)+cloudmac.substring(15,17);return(mac.toLowerCase()==localmac);}function Comparehost(cloudmac,hoststr){var mac=cloudmac.substring(0,2).toString()+cloudmac.substring(3,5)+cloudmac.substring(6,8)+cloudmac.substring(9,11)+cloudmac.substring(12,14)+cloudmac.substring(15,17);return(mac.toLowerCase()==localmac);}function onGetProfile(idx,wholemac,model){var exit,l2l=1;if(model.toUpperCase()==\"PC\"){l2l=0;}if(l2l==1){if(idx>0){if(aryVPNProf[idx-1][0]==\"???\"||aryVPNProf[idx-1][0]==\"\")exit=0;else exit=1;}if(idx==-1||exit==0){var mac=wholemac.substring(6,8)+wholemac.substring(9,11)+wholemac.substring(12,14)+wholemac.substring(15,17);if(exit==0&&idx!=-1)alert(gettext(\"Profile is deleted, please re-create this profile.\"));document.location=\"/cgi-bin/V2X00.cgi?sFormAuthStr=pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA&fid=2204&sAct=showVPNProfile&iProfileIdx=\"+idx+\"&mac=\"+mac;}else{document.location=\"/cgi-bin/lan2lan.cgi?sFormAuthStr=pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA&sAct=showitem&iProfileIdx=\"+idx;}}else{if(idx>0){if(aryRmVPNProf[idx-1]==\"???\"||aryRmVPNProf[idx-1]==\"\")exit=0;else exit=1;}if(idx==-1||exit==0){if(exit==0&&idx!=-1)alert(gettext(\"Profile is deleted, please re-create this profile.\"));document.location=\"/cgi-bin/V2X00.cgi?sFormAuthStr=pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA&fid=2204&sAct=showRMVPNProfile&iProfileIdx=\"+idx+\"&mac=\"+wholemac;}else{document.location=\"/cgi-bin/dialin.cgi?sFormAuthStr=pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA&sAct=showitem&iProfileIdx=\"+idx;}}}function onClkCfmCcl(){ $scope.vpninfo=0;$scope.$apply();}function onClkCfmOk(){f.submit();}function onClkOK(){if(f.iCloudSrvEn[0].checked){ $scope.vpninfo=1;$scope.$apply();return;}if(checkWebChange()){f.webchange.value='1';}f.submit();}function updateStunTest(){$http.get('/cloudvpnstuntest.cgi?sFormAuthStr=pU2VHFY4WAi1NkA').then(function(response){ var data=response.data;var tmp=data.split(\"|\");var res=tmp[0],addr=tmp[1];if(res==0)setTimeout(updateStunTest,2000);else{if(res==1){document.getElementById(\"stun_result\").innerHTML=gettext(\"Your external IP/port detected by STUN Server is ###ID###, your network environment is good to use VPN Matcher Mode.\").replace(\"###ID###\",addr);}else if(res==2){document.getElementById(\"stun_result\").innerHTML=gettext(\"Your NAT Type is symmetric NAT, VPN Matcher connection cannot be established. Your VPN Matcher setting is disabled now.\"); $scope.iCloudSrvEn=0;}else if(res==3){document.getElementById(\"stun_result\").innerHTML=gettext(\"Fail to get IP information from STUN Server, please check your network environment or contact your network administrator.\");}else if(res==5){document.getElementById(\"stun_result\").innerHTML=gettext(\"Your NAT gateway may have more than one WAN interface, cloud VPN may not be able to connect.\");}f.stun_detect.disabled=false;if(window.localStorage.getItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\")){window.localStorage.removeItem(\"CloudStunTestTime\");}}});}</script></body></html>"
